{"user": "what is the aim of this game simplified", "user_ts": "2026-08-21T13:06:43.065266+00:00", "assistant": "Simplified aim: **finish the game with more of your colour discs (Black) than White.**\n\nOn each move you place a black disc so it traps white discs in a line; those trapped discs flip to black. But near the end, the key is often **not** \u201cflip the most now\u201d \u2014 it\u2019s to **secure corners/edges and avoid giving White strong moves**.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-21T13:06:44.071238+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-21T13:06:45.678107+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "consensus": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "votes": {"Knowledge Deficit Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Knowledge Deficit Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "llama": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "sonnet": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["General Principle"], "consensus": ["General Principle"], "votes": {"General Principle": 3}, "confidence": {"General Principle": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["General Principle"], "llama": ["General Principle"], "sonnet": ["General Principle"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Direct Instruction"]}}
